      "content": "i dont know why i even bother trying to hold things together anymore. everything i care about is just... slipping away. it feels like watching a forest fire in slow motion. you know? you just stand there and watch everything beautiful turn to ash, and there's nothing you can actually do to stop it. what's the point of staying to watch the wreckage?",
