    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "freedom... it's a strange way to put it. but i guess if the world is just going to keep breaking and everything i love is already gone, fighting doesn't feel like much of a victory. it just feels like exhaustion. does it really just feel like being free once you decide you're done?",
